  "summary": "This experiment tested transformer aggregation with pca_n2000 RNA encoding in a multiprofile RNA-only setting, achieving validation accuracy of 0.5191 (F1 0.4797). The result suggests potential encoder-specific effects compared to the scvi_n200 baseline (config_006: 0.6530), but the exact contribution of the aggregation method remains uncertain due to confounding factors and limited comparative evidence."
